<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>STRINGS (feat. JVKE &amp; Bazzi)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">MAX, JVKE, Bazzi</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">STRINGS (feat. JVKE &amp; Bazzi)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7roB6h5rQPhFRK307eIQk6</ttm:item><itunes:duration>02:33.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.330" end="00:08.730">I hear strings play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.730" end="00:12.410">Every time you look my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.410" end="00:14.240">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.240" end="00:16.210">Oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.210" end="00:19.680">Feels like ooh oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.680" end="00:21.980">Make my heart beat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.980" end="00:25.760">Double time when you're on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.760" end="00:30.350">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.350" end="00:32.420">What you do what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.420" end="00:33.920">MAX：</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.560" end="00:35.800">Girl you mute out all the nonsense all the toxic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.800" end="00:39.130">We can talk on any topic and never stop it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.130" end="00:42.490">I know you got other options a lot of prospects</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.490" end="00:46.880">But they only know the single I want the box set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.880" end="00:48.380">JVKE：</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.130" end="00:49.130">Pushing buttons with your high heels</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.130" end="00:50.630">Or your high tops</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.410" end="00:52.410">Turning heads and give them all the feels</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.410" end="00:54.630">Way that you walk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.630" end="00:57.320">Could be a sign or I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.320" end="00:58.820">MAX：</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.510" end="00:59.410">Might be losing my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.410" end="01:02.020">Cause I hear strings play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.020" end="01:05.790">Every time you look my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.790" end="01:07.490">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.490" end="01:09.560">Oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.560" end="01:12.970">Feels like ooh oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.970" end="01:15.370">Make my heart beat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.370" end="01:19.170">Double time when you're on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.170" end="01:23.810">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.810" end="01:25.550">What you do what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.550" end="01:27.050">Bazzi：</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.700" end="01:27.200">Yeah yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.980" end="01:27.620">Girl you sound just like the theme song</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.620" end="01:29.140">Can turn my dreams on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.140" end="01:32.390">You the star of the movie I'm watching re-runs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.390" end="01:34.420">Want to cut off all my options</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.420" end="01:36.050">Put you on top of them</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.050" end="01:37.650">We just stepped outside in public</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.650" end="01:40.350">The cameras poppin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.350" end="01:43.730">Hold on to me right now I'll protect you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.730" end="01:47.000">You can ruin my life girl I'll let you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.000" end="01:48.500">Feel your heart when it's beating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.240" end="01:49.970">You the one girl and I'm fiending</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.970" end="01:52.960">I hear symphonies when you speaking it's true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.960" end="01:55.390">Cause I hear strings play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.390" end="01:59.110">Every time you look my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.110" end="02:00.780">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.780" end="02:02.880">Oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.880" end="02:06.270">Feels like ooh oh oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.270" end="02:08.740">Make my heart beat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.740" end="02:12.460">Double time when you're on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.460" end="02:17.020">Don't you know that's what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.020" end="02:23.770">What you do what you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.770" end="02:27.770">What you do</p></div></body></tt>